"text.7c151dc3447d000f" = "Hidden extensions delete explicit values in the current user's domain, even if another tool or user command wrote them. System Settings enhancements and mirrors restore only snapshots saved before this app took control. Enhancements and mirrors not taken over by this app are left unchanged.";
"text.652d1b0347571654" = "Advanced operations";
"text.505ba8cf741b8e6f" = "Current user only";
"text.4e656d1fe347d7d8" = "Each change requires system authorization";
"text.ec03b00de6920704" = "No administrator permission needed";
"text.dea35ec5d2a50946" = "Terminal Settings";
"text.37fbbf2e26d4b4e5" = "Safely manage hidden preferences and exact System Settings values";
"text.58460c1f8471e173" = "explicitly configured";
"text.a2908f64f284f2e6" = "Safety boundaries";
"text.a325e7d60096178d" = "Ordinary categories need no elevation, and organization-managed preferences remain read-only. Advanced settings perform only allowlisted Boolean pmset operations and request administrator authorization for each change. This app does not disable SIP, Gatekeeper, or file quarantine. All writes are verified, rolled back on failure, and recorded for undo.";
"text.5d0481f72d574647" = "A successful write is not proof of an effect";
"text.a787a4b53b1b5c0b" = "Experimental means the implementation is undocumented. An additional Unstable label means value semantics, visible effects, or coverage remain uncertain. The app verifies that preferences were written, but does not treat readback as proof of an effect. Every unstable setting includes a specific explanation.";
"text.994011f66ce34362" = "Browse settings";
"text.8b787312fe4719d1" = "Every switch includes an equivalent command preview. Execution does not use a shell or interpret special characters in input.";
"text.3cb47c74d01a9129" = "Administrator authorization boundaries";
"text.c77e6831df66dcb8" = "Each switch is confirmed separately and requests administrator authorization from macOS; recent authentication may be reused. Only fixed 0/1 arguments are passed directly to /usr/bin/pmset. No shell or arbitrary commands are accepted. Unsupported hardware capabilities remain unavailable.";
"text.c83b87fa72a4f821" = "Legacy gesture experiments";
"text.a4690cd1bcf7994d" = "These gestures have known preference addresses, fixed scalar values, and delete-to-restore paths, but their semantics or effects on this OS are unverified. Writes may have no effect, be overwritten, or require logging in again. Read each Unstable note first.";
"text.b8989db766e5a206" = "Turning an advanced switch off explicitly writes 0. In-app undo restores the actual prior values for each power source.";
"text.c25249f149adf668" = "Hidden extensions delete explicit current-user values after confirmation, regardless of origin. System Settings enhancements and mirrors save and restore previous values; deleting a key is not treated as restoring the original setting.";
"text.3ad236f0b5abbc7a" = "语言 / Language";
